<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Sahifa topilmadi</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .error-box {
            background: white;
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 500px;
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 100px;
            margin: 0;
            color: #ff5722;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #333;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        p {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            background: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #2E7D32;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-box">
        <h1>404</h1>
        <h2>Sahifa topilmadi</h2>
        <p>Kechirasiz, siz so'ragan sahifa mavjud emas</p>
        <a href="/" class="btn">Bosh sahifaga qaytish</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>